WEBVTT

00:00:03.195 --> 00:00:06.065
Tick the activities you want on the page.

00:00:06.065 --> 00:00:07.775
Here, two sales calls.

00:00:09.274 --> 00:00:10.676
Pick an action.

00:00:10.676 --> 00:00:14.746
Assign shares activities between users and resets them.

00:00:14.746 --> 00:00:17.014
Reschedule moves their date.

00:00:17.014 --> 00:00:19.283
Purge removes them for good.

00:00:19.283 --> 00:00:24.087
Set Instructions and Set Urgency Level change what the agent sees.

00:00:24.087 --> 00:00:29.958
Change Subject, Clear Assignment, Change Source and Change Campaign move the work.

00:00:29.958 --> 00:00:33.894
Here, Set Urgency Level to High, then Execute Action.

00:00:34.345 --> 00:00:39.210
To act on every result of the filter, including other pages, tick Apply

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:41.296
to all matching activities.

00:00:41.296 --> 00:00:44.835
Here, every sales call gets the same instructions.

